    "assembly": "Multipart body, boundary '----opalreader-final-envelope-d1': metadata part first (Content-Type application/json), then module parts sorted by part name, each 'Content-Disposition: form-data; name=\"<part>\"; filename=\"<part>\"' + 'Content-Type: application/javascript+module', CRLF framing, closing '--<boundary>--\\r\\n'.",
    "envelopeSha256": "SHA-256 of the assembled multipart body. Per-part SHA-256 is over the part's payload bytes exactly as uploaded (build-identity: the STAMPED bytes for the operative fields; the tree bytes for the unstamped fields).",
    "pinSubstitution": "Replacing the placeholder with the real 40-char deploy pin changes ONLY the build-identity part's bytes (same length, 411 B) and therefore only that part's sha256 and the envelope sha256. All byte counts are pin-invariant (verified in this package with a second 40-char pin)."
